# RaidBossType4 (25319), level 1 like the level 1 character, is hit for 22. RaidBossStandard
# wants to attack the character at 22 / (1 + 7) * 20000, which makes it the boss's top desire
# target; the hit, one on its party too, then reaches the party-attacked hook. The character
# being its top desire target, it wants neither ranged debuff; on a draw of 0 in 75 it wants
# its DD magic (DD_MAGIC_A, 4077) on the character at 1000000. Seeing the character cast
# Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster beside it, on another draw of 0 it wants the DD magic
# again, adding 1000000. Its ranged debuffs on a hit or a spell by another than its top desire
# target, and a hit on a private, are in tests/ai/raid_boss6_test.go: the format places no
# template privates and sets no top desire target. The character's combat draws are pinned so
# the debuff lands.
character Hunter 1
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossParty
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossType4
npc boss 25319 RaidBoss 250 0 0 skill DD_MAGIC_A 4077 8
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 0 0

hit boss 22
  desires boss attack(player)=55000 cast(player,4077,move)=1000000
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires boss attack(player)=55000 cast(player,4077,move)=2000000
